378a-b435-42b8-8f4b-284f4e544a2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cfccfb8688ece272a8c18a7ebd88a0be, https://si.imgix.net/475f6799/uploads/origins/5fb4378a-b435-42b8-8f4b-284f4e544a2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aff167c68563356ba5690bfab6443bc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/475f6799/uploads/origins/5fb4378a-b435-42b8-8f4b-284f4e544a2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82a76f8e437b308360451239d1f5c9d0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Please draw me and my two cats thank you very much. :)\nCats: https://sta.sh/2u6w8dgku0f?edit=1\nThe orange cat is well-mannered and affectionate but likes to play\nwhile the grey cat is mischievous but has a sweet personality.\nDrawing of me: https://sta.sh/24o2kyts75i?edit=1\nMy hair is black and wavy. And you can draw me in any outfit you would like.\nThank you for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}